<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Allied Waste started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Allied Waste started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch initiated coverage of Allied Waste Industries Inc as an intermediate-term accumulate and long-term buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Allied Waste gained 7/16 to 15-1/4.</p>
</text>
